{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "092fccc423e36f794b5900cc45b15bfb023bd18b70470bfb0cdb51d0eec02c8d", "ja": "ふぁ～。……ねむいなぁ。\n今日はお仕事もだいたい終わったし\nなんだか気が緩んじゃう……。", "zh": "哈啊～……好困啊。\n今天的工作也差不多都结束了，\n不知不觉就放松下来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0e8c72bb067ce2efefdf43d0104d8745b2ff6596975863ed402f073e903f96c1", "ja": "春って、毎年こうなっちゃうん\nだよね。えっと、\n春眠暁を覚えず、だっけ……。", "zh": "春天每年都会这样呢。呃，\n\"春眠不觉晓\"，是这句吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "6e001995044d7a91db12b3234d4ed1c206da2d003524cf6ef92fae5c7fd5ff79", "ja": "……ふぁふ。ふぁ～。\nああ、ダメダメ！\nしっかりしなきゃ……！", "zh": "……哈欠。哈——\n啊，不行不行！\n得打起精神来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "530e6770b70e8449f94a94f72a40f3fab56d38cdff7f618e63062d2e38574070", "ja": "……でも、いっか♪\nたまにはこんな日があっても。\n春だし、ね～♪", "zh": "……不过，算啦♪\n偶尔有这么一天也无所谓嘛。\n毕竟春天到了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
